  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Get the enrolment link",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open your Deploy App team, then <strong>Add hosts</strong> and <strong>Android</strong>. Send the link to the phones, as many as you like.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/be65720cb87b22b7.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1326
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the link on the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the link and tap <strong>Enroll</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/13980932ec6c3a74.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set up the work profile",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Next</strong>, and <strong>Continue</strong> if asked.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e7f89bb3db7e6a4b.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Accept &#x26; continue</strong>, then <strong>Next</strong> if asked.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0d676c54c6c7569.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Done</strong>. The apps arrive in the work profile. The phone now waits for its name.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6ff5b74a5a7be991.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Phones already in Fleet",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Enrolled in another team? Tick the phones in Fleet, choose <strong>Transfer</strong> and pick your Deploy App team. For this team's apps too, enrol them again here.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/80b224e7ffe15bee.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1210
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
